  },
  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "ポケモンに　かおりを　かがせると\nとくこうが　あがりやすく　なるが\nこうげきは　あがりにくくなる　ミント。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "포켓몬에게 향기를 맡게 하면\n특수공격이 오르기 쉬워지지만\n공격이 오르기 어려워지는 민트.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "讓寶可夢聞這種薄荷的氣味，\n會令特攻變得容易提高，\n但攻擊則難以提高。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Si un Pokémon hume cet aromate, son Attaque Spéciale\nmontera plus facilement, mais son Attaque\nse développera plus lentement.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Lässt man ein Pokémon an dieser Minze schnuppern,\nsteigt sein Spezial-Angriff schneller, aber sein Angriff\numso langsamer.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Cuando un Pokémon percibe su aroma, aumenta con\nmás facilidad su Ataque Especial, en detrimento de su\nAtaque.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Quando un Pokémon ne sente il profumo,\nil suo Attacco Speciale aumenta più facilmente\na scapito dell’Attacco.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "When a Pokémon smells this mint, its Sp. Atk will grow\nmore easily, but its Attack will grow more slowly.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "ポケモンに　香りを　かがせると\n特攻が　上がりやすく　なるが\n攻撃は　上がりにくくなる　ミント。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "宝可梦闻了这种薄荷之后，\n会令特攻容易提高，\n而攻击则难以提高。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
